{"text": " Modern finance is a game of trust, but trust is a friction. The real engine of wealth isn't the trade, it is the clearing. In 1853, 52 banks in New York were drowning in their own gold. Porter's walked Miles daily just to settle individual debts between branches. It was slow, it was dangerous, it was an 18th century bottleneck. Then came the clearinghouse, a single room where all debts met. They didn't move the gold, they just moved the numbers. By netting the totals, they reduced physical gold movement by 95%. Efficiency created the first true network effect in American banking. Today, this invisible plumbing settles $2 trillion every single day. The winner isn't the one with the most gold. It's the one who controls the ledger.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 6.52, "text": " Modern finance is a game of trust, but trust is a friction. The real engine of wealth isn't", "tokens": [50364, 19814, 10719, 307, 257, 1216, 295, 3361, 11, 457, 3361, 307, 257, 17710, 13, 440, 957, 2848, 295, 7203, 1943, 380, 50688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1225261085911801, "compression_ratio": 1.5365853658536586, "no_speech_prob": 0.0029348835814744234, "words": [{"word": " Modern", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.38, "probability": 0.9346548914909363}, {"word": " finance", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.84, "probability": 0.7344330549240112}, {"word": " is", "start": 0.84, "end": 1.24, "probability": 0.9980881810188293}, {"word": " a", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.34, "probability": 0.9981325268745422}, {"word": " game", "start": 1.34, "end": 1.54, "probability": 0.9969388246536255}, {"word": " of", "start": 1.54, "end": 1.74, "probability": 0.9995230436325073}, {"word": " trust,", "start": 1.74, "end": 2.02, "probability": 0.9970607161521912}, {"word": " but", "start": 2.58, "end": 2.94, "probability": 0.9946305751800537}, {"word": " trust", "start": 2.94, "end": 3.22, "probability": 0.9696837663650513}, {"word": " is", "start": 3.22, "end": 3.68, "probability"